@startuml
title Diagram 4 — Siklus Hidup Lead → Peluang

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

state "Lead Baru" as LB
state "Lead — Kualifikasi" as LK
state "Lead — Hilang" as LH
state "Kontak + Akun + Peluang\n(hasil konversi)" as CONV

[*] --> LB : lead ditangkap\n(manual / webhook inbound)
LB --> LK : penugasan ke sales\n+ mulai kualifikasi
LK --> LH : tidak lolos kualifikasi
LK --> CONV : konversi

state "Pipeline Peluang" as PIPE {
  state "Qualifikasi" as S1
  state "Analisis Kebutuhan" as S2
  state "Presentasi / Demo" as S3
  state "Proposal" as S4
  state "Negosiasi" as S5
  state "Menunggu Keputusan" as S6
  state "Closed-Won" as CW
  state "Closed-Lost" as CL

  [*] --> S1
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> CW : menang
  S6 --> CL : kalah (+alasan)
}

CONV --> S1
CW --> [*]
CL --> [*]

note right of PIPE
  Stage default: 6 stage + 2 outcome.
  Configurable per tenant; alur B2C boleh lebih pendek.
  Tahap prospecting tidak diulang di sini —
  sudah dilayani Lead Management.

  Nilai deal pada Closed-Won menjadi
  sumber revenue & quota attainment.
end note

note bottom of LH
  Alasan hilang dicatat untuk analisis,
  bukan untuk penilaian individu.
end note
@enduml
